1
00:00:00,972 --> 00:00:03,372
(Penny:)Oh, my God. What is with you guys?

2
00:00:03,575 --> 00:00:07,175
Well, it's not our fault.
Our dads never did anything like this with us.

3
00:00:07,378 --> 00:00:10,208
- What, never?
- My dad was an anthropologist.

4
00:00:10,415 --> 00:00:12,075
(Leonard:)The only father-son time he spent...

5
00:00:12,283 --> 00:00:16,053
(Leonard:)...was with a 2000-year-old skeleton
of an Etruscan boy.

6
00:00:16,754 --> 00:00:18,244
(Leonard:)I hated that kid.

7
00:00:20,091 --> 00:00:22,621
(Raj:)Mine just took me to his gynecology office.

8
00:00:22,827 --> 00:00:26,127
(Raj:)I got so bored, I'd put vaginal lubricant
at the bottom of my shoes...

9
00:00:26,331 --> 00:00:28,891
...and pretend I was ice skating.

10
00:00:33,271 --> 00:00:36,431
(Howard:)Yeah, well my quality father-son time
was spending my adolescence...

11
00:00:36,641 --> 00:00:40,841
...Iooking out the window,
waiting for my dad to come back some day.

12
00:00:42,447 --> 00:00:44,417
(Raj:)Yeah, okay, Howard wins.

13
00:00:45,783 --> 00:00:48,843
(Leonard:)We didn't have opportunities like this
when we were growing up...

14
00:00:49,087 --> 00:00:52,857
(Leonard:)...but right now there's a dad
that wants to take you on a fishing trip.

15
00:00:53,124 --> 00:00:55,594
You're right. Ugh. I should do this.

16
00:00:55,793 --> 00:00:57,783
Great. Ahem. Here you go.

17
00:00:57,996 --> 00:01:06,026
Now what you do is, you stick your thumb
down its throat, grab the guts and pull.

